  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 — Add RunOnStartup to ICronJob (breaking change); add CronJobBase convenience base class.\n            Set RunOnStartup = true on the job class to fire it once immediately on host start-up\n            (non-blocking), then continue on the normal cron schedule. CronJobBase provides a default\n            RunOnStartup = false so most jobs need no change. AddCronJobHostedService has no options\n            parameter; all job behaviour is configured on the job class itself.",
